dsh-volc-balance-card
=====================

This package is a fork of dsh-quota-panel
(https://github.com/wenzetan/dsh-quota-panel), licensed under the MIT License.
The upstream project provided the plugin skeleton this package still builds on:
the Volcengine request signer, the provider catalog, the host RPC surface, the
settings UI skeleton and the vendored libraries.

Changes made in this fork (see README for the user-facing view):

* Added the Volcengine account balance row backed by Billing QueryBalanceAcct,
  with balance tiers and 30s response caching.
* Added in-card AK/SK configuration, verification and clearing through the DSH
  credential service. The secret key is never returned to the browser.
* Removed the ChatGPT/Codex subscription block and every proxy setting, plus
  the related host code paths (fetch branch, auth endpoints, catalog entry).
* Changed the surface from a draggable floating overlay to a fixed card in the
  sidebar footer slot (sidebar.footer.action) with a collapsed capsule mode.

Vendored third-party code (unchanged, kept under src/vendor and copied into
lib/vendor by the build):

* schemastery.mjs — schemastery, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2020-present
  Shigma.

Files carried over from the upstream package and then modified:
src/index.ts, src/client.ts, cordis.patch.yml.

The MIT License text applies to the whole package; see LICENSE.
